    [4112]={name="Choker of the High Shaman",quality=2,ilvl=44,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Mok'thardin's Enchantment'. Starts with Far Seer Mok'thardin in Stranglethorn Vale. Objective: Far Seer Mok'thardin of Grom'gol needs Holy Spring Water. He also wants you to kill 10 Naga Explorers.",zone="Stranglethorn Vale",questName="Mok'thardin's Enchantment",lore="There is but one final reagent needed to complete the enchantment. In the south, towards the western coast, high above the bluffs, lies a Holy Spring."},
    [4113]={name="Medicine Blanket",quality=2,ilvl=45,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Stranglethorn Fever'. The quest is in Stranglethorn Vale. Objective: temp text 02 - log.",zone="Stranglethorn Vale",questName="Stranglethorn Fever"},
    [4114]={name="Darktide Cape",quality=2,ilvl=42,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Keep An Eye Out'. Starts with Dizzy One-Eye in Stranglethorn Vale. Objective: Dizzy One-Eye in Booty Bay wants you to retrieve his eye from the Bloodsail Buccaneers.",zone="Stranglethorn Vale",questName="Keep An Eye Out",lore="Avast! Who goes there? Argh, I am but useless without me special enchanted eye. Bad enough to have lost me eyes in battle in the first place!"},
    [4117]={name="Scorching Sash",quality=2,ilvl=44,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Akiris by the Bundle'. Starts with Privateer Bloads in Stranglethorn Vale. Objective: Bring 10 Bundles of Akiris Reed to Privateer Bloads in Booty Bay.",zone="Stranglethorn Vale",questName="Akiris by the Bundle",lore="You looking fer work? I might have some if you're up for a little challenge. I got a friend named Groy who makes a killing selling what the naga call akiris reed: it's some kind of valuable ocean reed."},
    [4120]={name="Robe of Crystal Waters",quality=2,ilvl=40,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Curse of the Tides'. Starts with Catelyn the Blade in Stranglethorn Vale. Objective: Destroy the Altar of the Tides with Catelyn's Blade, kill Gazban and bring the Stone of the Tides and Catelyn's Blade back to Baron Revilgaz.",zone="Stranglethorn Vale",questName="The Curse of the Tides",lore="So you're looking for an altar of some sort? Well, I'm no expert on troll ruins like my father, but I have heard about a sunken troll city out near that island you're looking for."},
    [4121]={name="Gemmed Gloves",quality=2,ilvl=35,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Hostile Takeover'. Starts with Kebok in Stranglethorn Vale. Objective: Retrieve 8 Tumbled Crystals and return them to Kebok in Booty Bay.",zone="Stranglethorn Vale",questName="Hostile Takeover",lore="He's done it this time! Bad enough that Gelriz's muscling out the moguls who were appointed by the trade princes, now he tries to cut in on the most notorious pirate!"},
    [4125]={name="Tranquil Orb",quality=2,ilvl=43,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Mai'Zoth'. Starts with Brother Nimetz in Stranglethorn Vale. Objective: Bring the Mind's Eye to Brother Nimetz at the Rebel Camp.",zone="Stranglethorn Vale",questName="Mai'Zoth",lore="Kurzen may be dead, but...that which drove him to evil still lives! Through my studies I have discovered this: An Ogre Mage - Mai'Zoth - dwells in an Ogre Mound within the eastern mountains of Stranglethorn."},
    [4130]={name="Smotts' Compass",quality=2,ilvl=50,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Facing Negolash'. Objective: Bring 10 Barbecued Buzzard Wings and 5 bottles of Junglevine Wine to Captain Smotts' Lifeboat.Kill Negolash, and bring Smotts' Cutlass to Captain Smotts in Stranglethorn.",zone="Stranglethorn Vale",questName="Facing Negolash",lore="Negolash is a hungry giant. When the giants destroyed our ship, Negolash went straight for my kitchen. He wasn't hungry for crew like the other giants."},
    [4133]={name="Darkspear Cuffs",quality=2,ilvl=37,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Headhunting'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Nimboya in Stranglethorn Vale. Objective: Bring 20 Shrunken Heads to Nimboya at the Grom'gol Base Camp.",zone="Stranglethorn Vale",questName="Headhunting",lore="We must find if Yenniku is dead. Slay the Bloodscalp Headhunters and take from them their Shrunken Heads. You must gather many, many heads, and I will inspect them to make sure Yenniku's head is not among them."},
    [4135]={name="Bloodbone Band",quality=2,ilvl=35,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Bloody Bone Necklaces'.",zone="Stranglethorn Vale",questName="Bloody Bone Necklaces",lore="I was sent to Grom'gol to aid Nimboya on his quest, but... I too have reasons for being here. The Bloodscalp tribe is enemy to our tribe. Collecting trophies of our enemies gives us power over them."},
    [4137]={name="Darkspear Shoes",quality=2,ilvl=42,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Split Bone Necklace'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Kin'weelay in Stranglethorn Vale. Objective: Bring 25 Split Bone Necklaces to Kin'weelay at the Grom'gol Base camp.",zone="Stranglethorn Vale",questName="Split Bone Necklace",lore="Now that you have gathered Bloodscalp trophies, I have another task for you. The Skullsplitter tribe of trolls live to the southeast, and for years we have warred with them."},
    [4139]={name="Junglewalker Sandals",quality=2,ilvl=37,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Report to Doren'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Corporal Sethman in Stranglethorn Vale. Objective: Speak with Lieutenant Doren.",zone="Stranglethorn Vale",questName="Report to Doren",lore="Did Lieutenant Doren want you to report back to him with that patrol information?"},
    [4140]={name="Palm Frond Mantle",quality=2,ilvl=34,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Bad Medicine'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Sergeant Yohwa in Stranglethorn Vale. Objective: Bring 7 Jungle Remedies and 1 Venom Fern Extract to Sergeant Yohwa at the Rebel Camp.",zone="Stranglethorn Vale",questName="Bad Medicine",lore="To have a chance against Kurzen, we need his healing support neutralized. He has gathered a large number of Medicine Men who heal his forces with Jungle Remedies and poison our fighters with Venom Fern Extracts."},
