    [21120]={name="Defiler's Talisman",quality=3,ilvl=33,reqLevel=28,sourceType="vendor",instructions="Bought from Rutherford Twing.",zone="Hammerfall",npc="Rutherford Twing",proc="Use: Absorbs 248 to 302 physical damage.  Lasts 15 sec. (3 Min Cooldown)"},
    [21128]={name="Staff of the Qiraji Prophets",quality=4,ilvl=75,reqLevel=60,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from The Prophet Skeram.",zone="Temple of Ahn'Qiraj",npc="The Prophet Skeram",lore="C'Thun's mouthpiece. Everything the qiraji believe, they believe because he told them the Old God said it."},
    [21179]={name="Band of Earthen Wrath",quality=3,ilvl=62,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Volunteer's Battlegear'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Vargus in Silithus. Objective: Bring 5 Cenarion Combat Badges, 3 Cenarion Logistics Badges and 7 Cenarion Tactical Badges to Vargus at Cenarion Hold in Silithus. You must also attain Friendly reputation with Cenarion Circle to be able to complete this quest.",zone="Silithus",questName="Volunteer's Battlegear",lore="The badges you collect from performing combat, logistics and tactical assignments for Cenarion Hold are more than just for show. You'd be wise to hold on to them."},
    [21182]={name="Band of Earthen Might",quality=3,ilvl=66,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Veteran's Battlegear'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Vargus in Silithus. Objective: Bring 7 Cenarion Combat Badges, 4 Cenarion Logistics Badges and 4 Cenarion Tactical Badges to Vargus at Cenarion Hold in Silithus. You must also attain Honored reputation with Cenarion Circle to be able to complete this quest.",zone="Silithus",questName="Veteran's Battlegear",lore="The badges you collect from performing combat, logistics and tactical assignments for Cenarion Hold are more than just for show. You'd be wise to hold on to them."},
    [21183]={name="Earthpower Vest",quality=3,ilvl=66,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Veteran's Battlegear'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Vargus in Silithus. Objective: Bring 7 Cenarion Combat Badges, 4 Cenarion Logistics Badges and 4 Cenarion Tactical Badges to Vargus at Cenarion Hold in Silithus. You must also attain Honored reputation with Cenarion Circle to be able to complete this quest.",zone="Silithus",questName="Veteran's Battlegear",lore="The badges you collect from performing combat, logistics and tactical assignments for Cenarion Hold are more than just for show. You'd be wise to hold on to them."},
    [21185]={name="Earthcalm Orb",quality=4,ilvl=62,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Stalwart's Battlegear'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Vargus in Silithus. Objective: Bring 15 Cenarion Combat Badges, 20 Cenarion Logistics Badges, 17 Cenarion Tactical Badges and 1 Mark of Remulos to Vargus at Cenarion Hold in Silithus. You must also attain Revered reputation with Cenarion Circle to be able to complete this quest.",zone="Silithus",questName="Stalwart's Battlegear",lore="The badges you collect from performing combat, logistics and tactical assignments for Windcaller Proudhorn are more than just for show. You'd be wise to hold on to them."},
    [21186]={name="Rockfury Bracers",quality=4,ilvl=62,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Stalwart's Battlegear'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Vargus in Silithus. Objective: Bring 15 Cenarion Combat Badges, 20 Cenarion Logistics Badges, 17 Cenarion Tactical Badges and 1 Mark of Remulos to Vargus at Cenarion Hold in Silithus. You must also attain Revered reputation with Cenarion Circle to be able to complete this quest.",zone="Silithus",questName="Stalwart's Battlegear",lore="The badges you collect from performing combat, logistics and tactical assignments for Windcaller Proudhorn are more than just for show. You'd be wise to hold on to them."},
    [21210]={name="Signet Ring of the Bronze Dragonflight",quality=4,ilvl=80,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Grand Invoker'. Starts with Anachronos in Tanaris. Objective: ProgressNever have I seen such tenacity! The Bronze Flight grants you one final enchantment. The Timeless One himself has requested it so!Hand me your signet ring so that I may make the necessary adjustments.",zone="Tanaris",questName="The Grand Invoker"},
    [21244]={name="Blessed Qiraji Pugio",quality=4,ilvl=79,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Imperial Qiraji Armaments'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Ahn'Qiraj",questName="Imperial Qiraji Armaments",lore="We have not sat idly by for a millennium. We have watched these beasts feast on their own when they have exhausted their utility. We have listened as they have plotted and schemed to destroy our world."},
    [21273]={name="Blessed Qiraji Acolyte Staff",quality=4,ilvl=79,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Imperial Qiraji Regalia'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Ahn'Qiraj",questName="Imperial Qiraji Regalia",lore="I speak of Elementium, mortal. Find and bring me Imperial Qiraji Regalia and the toxic element and I shall infuse weapons of great power."},
    [21311]={name="Earth Warder's Vest",quality=2,ilvl=48,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Timbermaw Ally'. Pick it over the other reward choices. The quest is in Felwood. Objective: Grazle wants you to prove yourself by killing 5 Deadwood Warriors, 5 Deadwood Pathfinders, and 5 Deadwood Gardeners.",zone="Felwood",questName="Timbermaw Ally",lore="The Timbermaw are the only furbolg tribe to escape the corruption. However, many other races kill furbolg blindly now, without bothering to see if they are friend or foe."},
    [21318]={name="Earth Warder's Gloves",quality=2,ilvl=58,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Winterfall Activity'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Salfa in Winterspring. Objective: Salfa wants you to kill 8 Winterfall Shaman, 8 Winterfall Den Watchers, and 8 Winterfall Ursa. Salfa is located just outside the entrance to Timbermaw Hold in Winterspring.",zone="Timbermaw Hold",questName="Winterfall Activity",lore="The Timbermaw tend to stay to themselves. While we do allow safe passage to those we trust, we try to avoid other furbolg tribes if at all possible."},
    [21334]={name="Doomcaller's Robes",quality=4,ilvl=88,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Doomcaller's Robes'. Starts with Vethsera in Ahn'Qiraj. Objective: Bring the the Husk of the Old God, 2 Idols of Night, 5 Stone Scarabs and 5 Crystal Scarabs to Vethsera inside Ahn'Qiraj. You must also attain Honored reputation with the Brood of Nozdormu to complete this quest.",zone="Ahn'Qiraj",questName="Doomcaller's Robes",lore="The unmentionable Old God slowly awakens from his slumber beneath Ahn'Qiraj. The terrible fate that awaits Azeroth could come in days or years; time has no meaning for beings of his power."},
    [21335]={name="Doomcaller's Mantle",quality=4,ilvl=78,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Doomcaller's Mantle'. Starts with Andorgos in Ahn'Qiraj. Objective: Bring the Qiraji Bindings of Dominance, 2 Idols of the Sage, 5 Bronze Scarabs and 5 Bone Scarabs to Andorgos in Ahn'Qiraj. You must also attain Neutral reputation with the Brood of Nozdormu to complete this quest.",zone="Ahn'Qiraj",questName="Doomcaller's Mantle",lore="It is said among us that the ornate shoulder armor worn by the mortal races started as an attempt to emulate the wings of a dragon."},
    [21336]={name="Doomcaller's Trousers",quality=4,ilvl=81,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Doomcaller's Trousers'. Starts with Kandrostrasz in Ahn'Qiraj. Objective: Bring the Skin of the Great Sandworm, 2 Idols of Rebirth, 5 Gold Scarabs and 5 Clay Scarabs to Kandrostrasz inside Ahn'Qiraj. You must also attain Friendly reputation with the Brood of Nozdormu to complete this quest.",zone="Ahn'Qiraj",questName="Doomcaller's Trousers",lore="You seek to prove your worth to my kind, mortal? Very well, perhaps we can be of mutual assistance. The ancient sandworm, Ouro, is a being of legendary power."},
    [21337]={name="Doomcaller's Circlet",quality=4,ilvl=81,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Doomcaller's Circlet'. Starts with Andorgos in Ahn'Qiraj. Objective: Bring Vek'nilash's Circlet, 2 Idols of Death, 5 Silver Scarabs and 5 Bone Scarabs to Andorgos in Ahn'Qiraj. You must also attain Friendly reputation with the Brood of Nozdormu to complete this quest.",zone="Ahn'Qiraj",questName="Doomcaller's Circlet",lore="The Twin Emperors... their incessant whispers are slowly taking a toll on my sanity. They mock me, knowing I cannot step further into their domain to save my brother Arygos."},
    [21338]={name="Doomcaller's Footwraps",quality=4,ilvl=78,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Doomcaller's Footwraps'. Starts with Kandrostrasz in Ahn'Qiraj. Objective: Bring the Qiraji Bindings of Dominance, 2 Idols of Night, 5 Clay Scarabs and 5 Ivory Scarabs to Kandrostrasz in Ahn'Qiraj. This quest also requires Neutral faction with the Brood of Nozdormu.",zone="Ahn'Qiraj",questName="Doomcaller's Footwraps",lore="Qiraji magic is strong and ancient. The most powerful qiraji wield items of such might, they'd give pause even to a dragon."},
    [21416]={name="Kris of Unspoken Names",quality=4,ilvl=70,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Kris of Unspoken Names'. Starts with Warden Haro in Silithus. Objective: Bring 1 Qiraji Ornate Hilt, 2 Onyx Idols, 5 Gold Scarabs and 5 Clay Scarabs to Warden Haro in Silithus. You must also attain Exalted reputation with Cenarion Circle to complete this quest.",zone="Ahn'Qiraj",questName="Kris of Unspoken Names",lore="The Qiraji and their servants wield items made with the rarest and finest materials: bones from gargantuan ancient creatures, gems from the depths of the earth, metals pure and strong."},
    [21417]={name="Ring of Unspoken Names",quality=4,ilvl=65,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Ring of Unspoken Names'. Starts with Windcaller Yessendra in Silithus. Objective: Bring 1 Qiraji Ceremonial Ring, 2 Jasper Idols, 5 Stone Scarabs and 5 Crystal Scarabs to Windcaller Yessendra in Silithus. You must also attain Honored reputation with Cenarion Circle to complete this quest.",zone="Ahn'Qiraj",questName="Ring of Unspoken Names",lore="The gems that adorn Qiraji idols would work quite well, as their quality is superior. Bring me the ring and idols and I'll create a powerful ring for you."},
    [21418]={name="Shroud of Unspoken Names",quality=4,ilvl=67,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Shroud of Unspoken Names'.",zone="Ahn'Qiraj",questName="Shroud of Unspoken Names",lore="I'm glad to hear you're aiding us in our attack on Ahn'Qiraj. I can make you a protective item that'll be of assistance in the fight against our enemy."},
    [21468]={name="Mantle of Maz'Nadir",quality=3,ilvl=74,reqLevel=60,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Moam.",zone="Ruins of Ahn'Qiraj",npc="Moam",lore="A stone giant pressed into qiraji service, who drains the mana of everyone fighting him and turns to rock when full."},
    [21489]={name="Quicksand Waders",quality=3,ilvl=73,reqLevel=60,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Buru the Gorger.",zone="Ruins of Ahn'Qiraj",npc="Buru the Gorger"},
    [21496]={name="Bracers of Qiraji Command",quality=3,ilvl=71,reqLevel=60,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from General Rajaxx.",zone="The Scarab Wall",npc="General Rajaxx",lore="Commander of the qiraji army, who threw wave after wave at the Scarab Wall in the War of the Shifting Sands and came back to do it again."},
    [21504]={name="Charm of the Shifting Sands",quality=4,ilvl=70,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Fall of Ossirian'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Objective: Deliver the Head of Ossirian the Unscarred to Commander Mar'alith at Cenarion Hold in Silithus.",zone="Ruins of Ahn'Qiraj",questName="The Fall of Ossirian",lore="A terrible menace has been laid to rest. The cruel Ossirian has been vanquished. The denizens of Kalimdor would be relieved to know of this victory."},
    [21517]={name="Gnomish Turban of Psychic Might",quality=4,ilvl=75,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Only Prescription'. Starts with Narain Soothfancy in Molten Core. Objective: Recover the 8 lost chapters of Draconic for Dummies and combine them with the Magical Book Binding and return the completed book of Draconic for Dummies: Volume II to Narain Soothfancy in Tanaris.",zone="Tanaris",questName="The Only Prescription",lore="I should have known. My arch-enemy, Doctor Weavil, up to his old tricks! And now, thanks to your failure in Winterspring, Doctor Weavil has destroyed my book!"},
    [21563]={name="Don Rodrigo's Band",quality=4,ilvl=65,reqLevel=60,sourceType="vendor",instructions="Bought from Gaelden Hammersmith.",zone="Alterac Valley",npc="Gaelden Hammersmith"},
    [21565]={name="Rune of Perfection",quality=3,ilvl=45,reqLevel=40,sourceType="vendor",instructions="Bought from the Warsong Gulch quartermaster with marks of honor. Alliance: Illiyana Moonblaze at Silverwing Grove, Ashenvale. Horde: Kelm Hargunth at Mor'shan Base Camp, The Barrens."},
    [21566]={name="Rune of Perfection",quality=3,ilvl=25,reqLevel=20,sourceType="vendor",instructions="Bought from the Warsong Gulch quartermaster with marks of honor. Alliance: Illiyana Moonblaze at Silverwing Grove, Ashenvale. Horde: Kelm Hargunth at Mor'shan Base Camp, The Barrens."},
    [21585]={name="Dark Storm Gauntlets",quality=4,ilvl=88,reqLevel=60,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from C'Thun.",zone="Temple of Ahn'Qiraj",npc="C'Thun",lore="An Old God, buried under Ahn'Qiraj by the titans rather than killed. It has been whispering to the qiraji ever since, and the whole war exists because it never stopped."},
    [21597]={name="Royal Scepter of Vek'lor",quality=4,ilvl=81,reqLevel=60,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Emperor Vek'lor.",zone="Temple of Ahn'Qiraj",npc="Emperor Vek'lor",lore="Twin emperor of the qiraji, and the one who inherited C'Thun's gift for magic instead of his brother's strength. Neither twin can be killed far from the other."},
    [21600]={name="Boots of Epiphany",quality=4,ilvl=81,reqLevel=60,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Emperor Vek'lor.",zone="Temple of Ahn'Qiraj",npc="Emperor Vek'lor",lore="Twin emperor of the qiraji, and the one who inherited C'Thun's gift for magic instead of his brother's strength. Neither twin can be killed far from the other."},
    [21608]={name="Amulet of Vek'nilash",quality=4,ilvl=81,reqLevel=60,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Emperor Vek'nilash.",zone="Temple of Ahn'Qiraj",npc="Emperor Vek'nilash",lore="Twin emperor of the qiraji, and the stronger arm of the pair. Kill one and the other heals him, so both must fall together."},
    [21611]={name="Burrower Bracers",quality=4,ilvl=81,reqLevel=60,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Ouro.",npc="Ouro",lore="A sandworm grown enormous under the desert, surfacing only to feed."},
    [21615]={name="Don Rigoberto's Lost Hat",quality=4,ilvl=81,reqLevel=60,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Ouro.",npc="Ouro",lore="A sandworm grown enormous under the desert, surfacing only to feed."},
    [21619]={name="Gloves of the Messiah",quality=4,ilvl=78,reqLevel=60,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Princess Huhuran.",zone="Temple of Ahn'Qiraj",npc="Princess Huhuran",lore="A qiraji brood matron whose poison is potent enough that the fight is really a race against her venom."},
    [21648]={name="Recomposed Boots",quality=4,ilvl=76,reqLevel=60,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Battleguard Sartura.",zone="Temple of Ahn'Qiraj",npc="Battleguard Sartura",lore="The qiraji empire's finest soldier, who fights with her honour guard and refuses to be separated from them."},
    [21663]={name="Robes of the Guardian Saint",quality=4,ilvl=77,reqLevel=60,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Fankriss the Unyielding.",zone="Temple of Ahn'Qiraj",npc="Fankriss the Unyielding",lore="A vast qiraji burrower that spawns its young mid-fight and hurls intruders into the walls."},
    [21678]={name="Necklace of Purity",quality=4,ilvl=76,reqLevel=60,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Battleguard Sartura.",zone="Temple of Ahn'Qiraj",npc="Battleguard Sartura",lore="The qiraji empire's finest soldier, who fights with her honour guard and refuses to be separated from them."},
    [21709]={name="Ring of the Fallen God",quality=4,ilvl=88,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Savior of Kalimdor'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Caelestrasz in Ahn'Qiraj. Objective: Take the Eye of C'Thun to Anachronos at the Caverns of Time.",zone="Ahn'Qiraj",questName="The Savior of Kalimdor",lore="To the Caverns of Time you go, Lord:Lady;. Anachronos awaits your return. Give him the eye of C'Thun as he will undoubtedly wish to place it in his master's collection."},
    [21809]={name="Fury of the Forgotten Swarm",quality=3,ilvl=71,reqLevel=60,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Colonel Zerran.",zone="Ruins of Ahn'Qiraj",npc="Colonel Zerran"},
    [21836]={name="Ritssyn's Ring of Chaos",quality=4,ilvl=71,reqLevel=60,sourceType="world_drop",instructions="World drop around level 60-62."},
    [22070]={name="Deathmist Belt",quality=3,ilvl=65,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Just Compensation'. Starts with Mokvar in Orgrimmar. Objective: Bring a Shadowcraft Belt and a set of Shadowcraft Gloves to Mokvar in Orgrimmar.",zone="Ironforge",questName="Just Compensation",lore="I believe a reward is in order if I'm to keep you interested in saving my skin. Bring me the belt and set of gloves that you wish to upgrade."},
    [22071]={name="Deathmist Bracers",quality=3,ilvl=65,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'An Earnest Proposition'. Starts with Deliana in Ironforge. Objective: Acquire 15 Winterspring Blood Samples and 20 gold and bring them along with a set of Lightforge Bracers to Deliana in Ironforge.",zone="Ironforge",questName="An Earnest Proposition",lore="I have in my possession a set of armor much like the one worn by those of your profession, but of much higher quality. I'd be willing to trade the bracers for ordinary ones in exchange for a small favor."},
    [22073]={name="Deathmist Mantle",quality=3,ilvl=65,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Anthion's Parting Words'. Objective: Return to Mokvar in Orgimmar with a set of Dreadmist Sandals, Dreadmist Leggings and Dreadmist Mantle.",zone="Ironforge",questName="Anthion's Parting Words",lore="Valthalak's soul was stored in this amulet. In our greed we foolishly split it into three parts, not knowing the curse that would await us. The only way to stop Valthalak's spell is to put the medallion back together."},
    [22075]={name="Deathmist Robe",quality=4,ilvl=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Saving the Best for Last'. Starts with Deliana in Ironforge. Objective: Give Deliana your Helm of Valor and Breastplate of Valor.",zone="Ironforge",questName="Saving the Best for Last",lore="That's an amazing story! You have my thanks, and the heartfelt gratitude of all who were involved. Now maybe I'll be able to sleep at night with both eyes shut."},
    [22076]={name="Deathmist Sandals",quality=4,ilvl=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Anthion's Parting Words'. Objective: Return to Mokvar in Orgimmar with a set of Dreadmist Sandals, Dreadmist Leggings and Dreadmist Mantle.",zone="Ironforge",questName="Anthion's Parting Words",lore="Valthalak's soul was stored in this amulet. In our greed we foolishly split it into three parts, not knowing the curse that would await us. The only way to stop Valthalak's spell is to put the medallion back together."},
    [22077]={name="Deathmist Wraps",quality=4,ilvl=55,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Just Compensation'. Starts with Mokvar in Orgrimmar. Objective: Bring a Shadowcraft Belt and a set of Shadowcraft Gloves to Mokvar in Orgrimmar.",zone="Ironforge",questName="Just Compensation",lore="You kept your word and brought the device built by Mux. I believe a reward is in order if I'm to keep you interested in saving my skin. Bring me the belt and set of gloves that you wish to upgrade."},
    [22149]={name="Beads of Ogre Mojo",quality=3,ilvl=63,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Falrin's Vendetta'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Falrin Treeshaper in Dire Maul. Objective: Collect 25 Ogre Warbeads from Ogres inside Dire Maul or Blackrock Spire and return to Falrin Treeshaper inside the Athenaeum in Dire Maul.",zone="Dire Maul",questName="Falrin's Vendetta",lore="Yet I'm not one to give out favors freely, even if you were sent here by an old friend. I hold nothing but hatred and contempt for our brutish ogre neighbors."},
    [22150]={name="Beads of Ogre Might",quality=3,ilvl=63,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Falrin's Vendetta'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Falrin Treeshaper in Dire Maul. Objective: Collect 25 Ogre Warbeads from Ogres inside Dire Maul or Blackrock Spire and return to Falrin Treeshaper inside the Athenaeum in Dire Maul.",zone="Dire Maul",questName="Falrin's Vendetta",lore="Yet I'm not one to give out favors freely, even if you were sent here by an old friend. I hold nothing but hatred and contempt for our brutish ogre neighbors."},
    [22225]={name="Dragonskin Cowl",quality=3,ilvl=60,reqLevel=55,sourceType="world_drop",instructions="Drops from Gyth (rare elite).",npc="Gyth"},
    [22301]={name="Ironweave Robe",quality=3,ilvl=63,reqLevel=58,sourceType="object_drop",instructions="Found in a container.",npc="a container"},
    [22302]={name="Ironweave Cowl",quality=3,ilvl=63,reqLevel=58,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Lord Valthalak.",npc="Lord Valthalak"},
    [22303]={name="Ironweave Pants",quality=3,ilvl=62,reqLevel=57,sourceType="world_drop",instructions="Drops from Kormok (rare elite).",npc="Kormok"},
    [22311]={name="Ironweave Boots",quality=3,ilvl=61,reqLevel=56,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from The Beast.",zone="Blackrock Spire",npc="The Beast"},
    [22313]={name="Ironweave Bracers",quality=3,ilvl=61,reqLevel=56,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Halycon.",zone="Blackrock Spire",npc="Halycon"},
    [22504]={name="Plagueheart Robe",quality=4,ilvl=92,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Plagueheart Robe'. Starts with Mataus the Wrathcaster in Eastern Plaguelands. Objective: Mataus the Wrathcaster at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make a Plagueheart Robe if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Robe, 25 Wartorn Cloth Scraps, 4 Mooncloth and 2 Nexus Crystals.",zone="Naxxramas",questName="Plagueheart Robe",lore="I make no pretenses, maggot. The darkness Plagueheart items hold could very well destroy the both of us."},
    [22505]={name="Plagueheart Leggings",quality=4,ilvl=88,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Plagueheart Leggings'. Starts with Mataus the Wrathcaster in Eastern Plaguelands. Objective: Mataus the Wrathcaster at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Plagueheart Leggings if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Leggings, 20 Wartorn Cloth Scraps, 4 Mooncloth and 2 Nexus Crystals.",zone="Naxxramas",questName="Plagueheart Leggings",lore="I make no pretenses, maggot. The darkness Plagueheart items hold could very well destroy the both of us."},
    [22506]={name="Plagueheart Circlet",quality=4,ilvl=88,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Plagueheart Circlet'. Starts with Mataus the Wrathcaster in Eastern Plaguelands. Objective: Mataus the Wrathcaster at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make a Plagueheart Circlet if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Circlet, 15 Wartorn Cloth Scraps, 3 Mooncloth and 3 Nexus Crystals.",zone="Naxxramas",questName="Plagueheart Circlet",lore="I make no pretenses, maggot. The darkness Plagueheart items hold could very well destroy the both of us."},
    [22507]={name="Plagueheart Shoulderpads",quality=4,ilvl=86,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Plagueheart Shoulderpads'. Starts with Mataus the Wrathcaster in Eastern Plaguelands. Objective: Mataus the Wrathcaster at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Plagueheart Shoulderpads if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Shoulderpads, 12 Wartorn Cloth Scraps, 2 Mooncloth and 3 Cured Rugged Hides.",zone="Naxxramas",questName="Plagueheart Shoulderpads",lore="I make no pretenses, maggot. The darkness Plagueheart items hold could very well destroy the both of us."},
    [22508]={name="Plagueheart Sandals",quality=4,ilvl=86,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Plagueheart Sandals'. Starts with Mataus the Wrathcaster in Eastern Plaguelands. Objective: Mataus the Wrathcaster at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Plagueheart Sandals if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Sandals, 12 Wartorn Cloth Scraps, 2 Mooncloth and 3 Cured Rugged Hides.",zone="Naxxramas",questName="Plagueheart Sandals",lore="I make no pretenses, maggot. The darkness Plagueheart items hold could very well destroy the both of us."},
    [22509]={name="Plagueheart Gloves",quality=4,ilvl=88,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Plagueheart Gloves'. Starts with Mataus the Wrathcaster in Eastern Plaguelands. Objective: Mataus the Wrathcaster at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Plagueheart Gloves if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Gloves, 8 Wartorn Cloth Scraps and 4 Mooncloth.",zone="Naxxramas",questName="Plagueheart Gloves",lore="I make no pretenses, maggot. The darkness Plagueheart items hold could very well destroy the both of us."},
    [22510]={name="Plagueheart Belt",quality=4,ilvl=88,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Plagueheart Belt'. Starts with Mataus the Wrathcaster in Eastern Plaguelands. Objective: Mataus the Wrathcaster at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make a Plagueheart Belt if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Belt, 8 Wartorn Cloth Scraps, 2 Arcane Crystals and 2 Mooncloth.",zone="Naxxramas",questName="Plagueheart Belt",lore="I make no pretenses, maggot. The darkness Plagueheart items hold could very well destroy the both of us."},
    [22511]={name="Plagueheart Bindings",quality=4,ilvl=88,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Plagueheart Bindings'. Starts with Mataus the Wrathcaster in Eastern Plaguelands. Objective: Mataus the Wrathcaster at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Plagueheart Bindings if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Bindings, 6 Wartorn Cloth Scraps, 1 Arcane Crystal and 1 Nexus Crystal.",zone="Naxxramas",questName="Plagueheart Bindings",lore="I make no pretenses, maggot. The darkness Plagueheart items hold could very well destroy the both of us."},
    [22630]={name="Atiesh, Greatstaff of the Guardian",quality=5,ilvl=90,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Atiesh, Greatstaff of the Guardian'. Objective: Anachronos at the Caverns of Time in Tanaris wants you to take Atiesh, Greatstaff of the Guardian to Stratholme and use it on Consecrated Earth. Defeat the entity that is exorcised from the staff and return to him.",questName="Atiesh, Greatstaff of the Guardian",lore="The Guardian's staff, broken and scattered. Rebuilding it means gathering forty splinters from Naxxramas, the base from Kel'Thuzad, and carrying it to the ruin of Karazhan where Medivh once held it.",proc="Use: Creates a portal, teleporting group members that use it to Karazhan. (1 Min Cooldown)"},
    [22652]={name="Glacial Vest",quality=4,ilvl=80,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Glacial Vest'. Starts with Craftsman Wilhelm in Eastern Plaguelands. Objective: Craftsman Wilhelm at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands wants 8 Frozen Runes, 8 Bolts of Runecloth, 6 Essences of Water, 4 Ironweb Spider Silks and 300 gold. You must also be of Exalted reputation with the Argent Dawn.",zone="Naxxramas",questName="Glacial Vest",lore="Thanks to you and Omarion, may he rest in peace, I am now able to create a Glacial vest."},
    [22654]={name="Glacial Gloves",quality=4,ilvl=80,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Glacial Gloves'. Starts with Craftsman Wilhelm in Eastern Plaguelands. Objective: Craftsman Wilhelm at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands wants 5 Frozen Runes, 4 Bolts of Runecloth, 4 Essences of Water, 2 Ironweb Spider Silks and 200 gold.",zone="Naxxramas",questName="Glacial Gloves",lore="Thanks to you and Omarion, may he rest in peace, I am now able to create Glacial gloves."},
    [22655]={name="Glacial Wrists",quality=4,ilvl=80,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Glacial Wrists'. Starts with Craftsman Wilhelm in Eastern Plaguelands. Objective: Craftsman Wilhelm at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands wants 4 Frozen Runes, 2 Bolts of Runecloth, 2 Essences of Water, 2 Ironweb Spider Silks and 200 gold.",zone="Naxxramas",questName="Glacial Wrists",lore="Thanks to you and Omarion, may he rest in peace, I am now able to create Glacial wrists."},
    [22657]={name="Amulet of the Dawn",quality=4,ilvl=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Epic Armaments of Battle - Friend of the Dawn'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Quartermaster Miranda Breechlock in Eastern Plaguelands. Objective: For 110 Insignias of the Dawn and 110 Insignias of the Crusade you may choose an item from the Argent Dawn's treasure cache.",zone="Eastern Plaguelands",questName="Epic Armaments of Battle - Friend of the Dawn",lore="Greetings, friend. Have you insignias of the Dawn or the Crusade that you would like to redeem for items of great power?"},
    [22659]={name="Medallion of the Dawn",quality=4,ilvl=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Epic Armaments of Battle - Friend of the Dawn'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Quartermaster Miranda Breechlock in Eastern Plaguelands. Objective: For 110 Insignias of the Dawn and 110 Insignias of the Crusade you may choose an item from the Argent Dawn's treasure cache.",zone="Eastern Plaguelands",questName="Epic Armaments of Battle - Friend of the Dawn",lore="Greetings, friend. Have you insignias of the Dawn or the Crusade that you would like to redeem for items of great power?"},
    [22667]={name="Bracers of Hope",quality=4,ilvl=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Epic Armaments of Battle - Friend of the Dawn'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Quartermaster Miranda Breechlock in Eastern Plaguelands. Objective: For 110 Insignias of the Dawn and 110 Insignias of the Crusade you may choose an item from the Argent Dawn's treasure cache.",zone="Eastern Plaguelands",questName="Epic Armaments of Battle - Friend of the Dawn",lore="Greetings, friend. Have you insignias of the Dawn or the Crusade that you would like to redeem for items of great power? I must warn you; purchases made at a friendly reputation with the Dawn come with an extremely hefty surcharge."},
    [22681]={name="Band of Piety",quality=3,ilvl=66,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Superior Armaments of Battle - Friend of the Dawn'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Quartermaster Miranda Breechlock in Eastern Plaguelands. Objective: For 30 Insignias of the Dawn and 30 Insignias of the Crusade you may choose an item from the Argent Dawn's treasure cache.",zone="Eastern Plaguelands",questName="Superior Armaments of Battle - Friend of the Dawn",lore="Greetings, friend. Have you insignias of the Dawn or the Crusade that you would like to redeem for items of power? I must warn you; purchases made at a friendly reputation with the Dawn come with a hefty surcharge."},
    [22700]={name="Glacial Leggings",quality=4,ilvl=80,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Only Song I Know...'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Craftsman Wilhelm in Eastern Plaguelands. Objective: Craftsman Wilhelm at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands wants you to bring him 2 Frozen Runes, 2 Essence of Water, 2 Blue Sapphires and 30 gold pieces.",zone="Naxxramas",questName="The Only Song I Know...",lore="You fancy yourself a hero of the Dawn, eh? I've seen our greatest soldiers get rolled over by Kel'Thuzad's plebes! How well could someone so clueless possibly fare in Naxxramas?"},
